This product includes software developed by QLIC contributors.

The Windows packages include decoder components from JPEG XL, Brotli, Highway,
SkCMS, and WebP. Their license texts are included with the decoder files.

The LZMS decoder is a C port of the MIT licensed clean room implementation by Deployment Theory.
Its license is in third_party/lzms/LICENSE.

Linux LZMS encoding uses the separately installed wimlib shared library.
Wimlib is copyright Eric Biggers and its library is available under LGPL 3.0 or later.
Wimlib is not included in QLIC. See third_party/wimlib/README.md.
